{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127810/extras/383a271d6628c2ae80da186a02860c7c.avif?t=1771325149\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127810/extras_big/383a271d6628c2ae80da186a02860c7c.webp?t=1771325149 width=1560 height=747 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Glory Survivor</strong> is a pixelated roguelike survivor game in which you choose a gladiator with unique traits <i>\u2014from a hero with a god complex to a short-sighted person who can't see two feet in front of them\u2014</i> and fight your way to conquer the colosseum arena. Choose your weapon, gain powers from the gods, summon creatures to help you, and combine skills to survive one more round. Every game is different. Every death is glorious.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127810/extras/1099587cdb92efeee8d2b76c488e6a93.poster.avif?t=1771325149\" width=688 height=468 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127810/extras/1099587cdb92efeee8d2b76c488e6a93.webm?t=1771325149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127810/extras/1099587cdb92efeee8d2b76c488e6a93.mp4?t=1771325149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every game is different, every combination can be deadly or triumphant. Experiment, die, improve, and repeat. Your only goal: <strong>survive and achieve glory</strong>. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automatic shooting, although you have to aim manually with most weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wide variety of characters with unique traits and different effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill system, with synergies between states.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive waves of 20 rounds to complete the arena.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase upgrades in the store to unlock skills and improvements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced action and roguelike progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High replayability: no two games are the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D pixel art style.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Gladiator apprentice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4127810/108b9032b389149e612318093feca35434a414de.jpg"},{"name":"Almost Gladiator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4127810/e480cc051da416bdb29fabc8109f54ff21736bd9.jpg"},{"name":"Experienced gladiator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4127810/fa7631e59749bc597d2d793c691ca7cca98c4602.jpg"},{"name":"Free","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4127810/4fcca29df7fda65199aae6cca3814b4a77ef763e.jpg"},{"name":"Cesar doesn't like you","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4127810/026c8d6a50693e1e154fbb497df9117f32f01f0d.jpg"},{"name":"Ave Cesar","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4127810/33d1c931457309d8c731281428ad9b137e22bcc8.jpg"},{"name":"Short-sighted","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4127810/a602a6290c585b6a015d8414a3bed0fa622aed7d.jpg"},{"name":"Farsighted","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4127810/26a51fee0444c4dd67918be3286e6c1bf46211e4.jpg"},{"name":"Rich","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/